                    coach_r2_scorecard:     `<strong>A focused scorecard is control.</strong> Six to eight KPIs across financial, customer, process and learning, each with a target and a clear line of sight to the 9% margin — that is a dashboard a manager can actually steer by. You replaced motion with margin.`,
