                    coach_r2_three:         `<strong>Three financials alone is too narrow.</strong> You will steer by lagging results with no customer, process or learning leading indicators — by the time margin moves, the quarter is over. Focus is right; amputation is not. Build the causal chain, not just the P&L line.`,
