                    coach_r2_eventadopt:    `<strong>You adopted the “orders shipped” bonus.</strong> Within a quarter, order count is up, average order size is down, and cost-to-serve is worse than before — you paid people to do the exact thing your diagnosis flagged. Goodhart’s law, on schedule.`,
